  "title": "分享一个监控游戏站sitemap的telegram机器人源码",
  "author": "魏文星",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/j5bcwdxuhz_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [],
  "content": "<div>源码地址：<a href=\"https://github.com/WeiWenxing/sitemap-diff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/WeiWenxing/sitemap-diff</a></div>\n<div>主要功能，就是订阅游戏站的sitemap地址，每天发送变化。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">环境要求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Python 3.8+</li>\n<li>pip</li>\n<li>virtualenv</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">安装步骤</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>克隆项目</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-bash\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">git</span><span> clone </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>项目地址</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">cd</span><span> site-bot</span></code></div></pre>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>创建并激活虚拟环境</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-bash\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\"># 创建虚拟环境</span><span>\n</span>python -m venv venv\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\"># Windows激活虚拟环境</span><span>\n</span><span>venv</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">\\</span><span>Scripts</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">\\</span><span>activate\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\"># Linux/Mac激活虚拟环境</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">source</span><span> venv/bin/activate</span></code></div></pre>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>安装依赖</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-bash\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>pip </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">install</span><span> -r requirements.txt</span></code></div></pre>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>配置环境变量</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-bash\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\"># 复制环境变量示例文件</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">cp</span><span> env.example .env\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\"># 编辑.env文件，填入必要的配置</span></code></div></pre>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">环境变量说明</h3>\n<div>必填配置:</div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN</code>: Telegram机器人token (从@BotFather获取)</li>\n<li><code>TELEGRAM_TARGET_CHAT</code>: 消息发送目标 (可以是频道如@channelname或用户ID如123456789)</li>\n</ul>\n<div>可选配置:</div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>DISCORD_TOKEN</code>: Discord机器人token (如需Discord功能则必填， 功能未开发)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">运行方式</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>直接运行</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-bash\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>python site-bot.py</span></code></div></pre>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>使用启动脚本（推荐）</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-bash\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\"># 添加执行权限</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">chmod</span><span> +x restart.sh\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\"># 运行脚本</span><span>\n</span>./restart.sh</code></div></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">日志查看</h2>\n<div>程序运行日志位于：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-bash\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">tail</span><span> -f /tmp/site-bot.log</span></code></div></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">目录结构</h2>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>project</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>\n</span><span>├── apps</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>                 # 应用入口层\n</span><span>│   ├── telegram_bot</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">py</span><span>\n</span><span>│   └── discord_bot</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">py</span><span>\n</span><span>├── core</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>                 # 核心配置层\n</span><span>│   └── config</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">py</span><span>        # 配置文件处理\n</span><span>├── services</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>            # 具体服务层\n</span><span>│   └── rss</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>            # </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">RSS</span><span>服务实现\n</span><span>├── storage</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>             # 数据存储层\n</span><span>└── site</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>bot</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">py</span><span>         # 主程序入口</span></code></div></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">注意事项</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>确保.env文件中配置了正确的bot token和发送目标</li>\n<li>运行restart.sh前确保在项目根目录</li>\n<li>首次运行时需要创建虚拟环境并安装依赖</li>\n<li>发送目标(TELEGRAM_TARGET_CHAT)必须配置，否则程序无法正常工作</li>\n</ol>",
